{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_34172","headline":"奉和袭美太湖诗二十首 圣姑庙 · 陆龟蒙","name":"奉和袭美太湖诗二十首 圣姑庙","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"渺渺洞庭水，盈盈芳屿神。\n因知古佳丽，不独湘夫人。\n流苏荡遥吹，斜领生轻尘。\n蜀彩駮霞碎，吴绡盘雾匀。\n可怜飞燕姿，合是乘鸾宾。\n坐想烟雨夕，兼知花草春。\n空登油壁车，窈窕谁相亲。\n好赠玉条脱，堪携紫纶巾。\n殷勤拨香池，重荐汀洲苹。\n明朝动兰檝，不翅星河津。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"陆龟蒙","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_34172.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_34172","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}